WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.860
Today is the day before your procedure, and this is the most important day of your prep,

2
00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:06.680
so let's make it count.

3
00:00:06.680 --> 00:00:11.780
Starting today you must drink clear liquids only, which includes water, broth, plain tea,

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:14.920
black coffee, clear juices, and plain gelatin.

5
00:00:14.920 --> 00:00:20.240
Stay well hydrated throughout the day, and remember, no solid foods, no alcohol, and

6
00:00:20.240 --> 00:00:21.680
no dairy.

7
00:00:21.680 --> 00:00:25.760
Avoid anything red, purple, blue, or orange, as these dyes can be mistaken for blood during

8
00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.640
the procedure.

9
00:00:27.640 --> 00:00:32.040
Begin your bowel prep exactly when your prep instruction sheet says to, don't skip ahead

10
00:00:32.040 --> 00:00:33.280
or delay.

11
00:00:33.280 --> 00:00:38.560
If you're on a split-dose schedule, your second dose will be taken the morning of your procedure.

12
00:00:38.560 --> 00:00:42.040
Your instruction sheet will have the exact timing for that.

13
00:00:42.040 --> 00:00:46.400
One important note about your ride tomorrow, ride shares and taxis are fine for getting you

14
00:00:46.400 --> 00:00:51.880
to your procedure, but after your procedure you may only use a ride share or taxi if a companion

15
00:00:51.880 --> 00:00:55.040
who is 18 or older is in the car with you.

16
00:00:55.040 --> 00:00:58.600
Going home alone in a ride share or taxi is not permitted, please make sure you have that

17
00:00:58.600 --> 00:00:59.920
arranged in advance.

18
00:00:59.920 --> 00:01:01.240
You're almost there, stick with it.
